        "v": 5,
        "title": "Include message history in planning prompt",
        "summary": "planComplexChange in backend/src/planning.ts now accepts messageHistory and injects prior turns into the reasoning prompt. backend/src/main-prompt.ts passes the messages array to the planner. This ensures the planning agent has full conversational context when generating solutions.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T17:09:47.440Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The conversational assistant now remembers the previous turns in your discussion before it starts planning a response, rather than only seeing the latest question. When it generates a plan, it receives the full message history alongside the current request, so the reasoning prompt includes context like role and content from earlier exchanges. As a result, the assistant's solution accounts for what you and it have already talked about in the same session. Live today for internal tooling.",
