        "title": "Update knowledge file prompt instructions",
        "summary": "Modified `getExtraInstructionForUserPrompt` in `backend/src/main-prompt.ts` to explicitly forbid adding commentary or justification when updating knowledge files. The existing instruction now mandates silent updates, aligning with the directive to avoid unnecessary prose in internal documentation. This change applies to the backend main prompt logic.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T17:10:08.176Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When the assistant updates its internal knowledge files, it now does so silently instead of explaining or justifying the update in its response. This only affects the backend logic that decides whether to leave behind learned information for future reference, not what you type or how your code is processed. The assistant still updates knowledge files when appropriate, but no longer adds commentary about why it did so, making its output cleaner and more focused.",
